# 📌 Overview

This project demonstrates a production-style Kubernetes cluster deployment on AWS using:

* Terraform Infrastructure as Code
* kubeadm Kubernetes bootstrap
* Auto Scaling Groups
* Launch Templates
* cloud-init automation
* containerd runtime
* Flannel CNI networking
* AWS SSM Parameter Store integration

The infrastructure follows immutable infrastructure and self-healing node architecture patterns commonly used in production DevOps environments.

