# 🔧 Deployment Steps

## Initialize Terraform

```bash
terraform init
```

## Plan Infrastructure

```bash
terraform plan
```

## Deploy Infrastructure

```bash
terraform apply
```

## Verify Kubernetes Cluster

```bash
kubectl get nodes
kubectl get pods -A
```

