# Terraform + cloud-init Flow

```text
Terraform
    ↓
Provision AWS Infrastructure
    ↓
EC2 user_data executes cloud-init
    ↓
Install:
- containerd
- kubelet
- kubeadm
    ↓
Master initializes cluster
    ↓
Join token stored in SSM
    ↓
Worker nodes retrieve token
    ↓
Workers auto join cluster
```

